  - key: lightsRecipe.K1
    value: "tavan ampul\xFC (g\xF6lgeli) + masa lambas\u0131 (spot, g\xF6lgeli) +
      pano lambas\u0131 (spot #FFE2B8 58\xB0, g\xF6lgeli, 2,4; \u2605ek) + CRT s\u0131z\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131
      + telsiz kadran\u0131 + dolap i\xE7i (kapal\u0131yken kapal\u0131) \xB7 3 g\xF6lgeli"
  - key: lightsRecipe.MAP
    value: "K1 ile ayn\u0131; pano kadraj d\u0131\u015F\u0131nda \xB7 2 g\xF6lgeli"
  - key: lightsRecipe.K4
    value: "pano lambas\u0131 (spot #FFE2B8, 58\xB0, g\xF6lgeli) + tavan ampul\xFC
      (g\xF6lgesiz dolgu) + ortam 0,5 \xB7 1 g\xF6lgeli. K1\u2019de pano lambas\u0131
      2,4 \u015Fiddetle yan\u0131k. (\u2605ek 11-05: maket \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131
      ve oda ampulleri kalkt\u0131)"
  - key: lightsRecipe.K5a
    value: "tavan ampul\xFC + masa lambas\u0131 (g\xF6lgeli) + CRT s\u0131z\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131
      (g\xF6lgesiz) \xB7 dal\u0131\u015Fta CRT emissive 0,6 s\u2019de 1,4\xD7"
  - key: lightsRecipe.K8
    value: "tavan ampul\xFC + masa lambas\u0131 + koridor lambas\u0131 (kap\u0131
      a\xE7\u0131kken, g\xF6lgeli) + vuru\u015F lambas\u0131 (emission; amber = kap\u0131da
      aday) \xB7 3 g\xF6lgeli. (\u2605ek 11-05: ziyaret\xE7i ve \xF6l\xFCmc\xFCl
      k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 \u0131\u015F\u0131k yok)"
  - key: lightsRecipe.K9
    value: "tavan ampul\xFC + masa lambas\u0131 (g\xF6lgeli) + dolap i\xE7i ampul
      (g\xF6lgesiz) \xB7 2 g\xF6lgeli"
  - key: lightsRecipe.RAID
    value: "anahtar y\xF6nl\xFC \u0131\u015F\u0131k (g\xF6lgeli, 4096) + dolgu y\xF6nl\xFC
      \u0131\u015F\u0131k (g\xF6lgesiz) + ortam \xB7 1 g\xF6lgeli; son tur/sonu\xE7:
      hedef spotu (g\xF6lgeli) \xB7 2"
  - key: lightsRecipe.K6
    value: "\u2605ek: masa lambas\u0131 (spot, g\xF6lgeli) + tavan ampul\xFC (g\xF6lgeli)
      + ortam \xB7 fi\u015F a\u011Fz\u0131 lambas\u0131 emission (amber) \xB7 EVRAK
      hedef \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131 (nokta #FFB44A 0,55, menzil 0,35 m, g\xF6lgesiz;
      fi\u015F \xFCst\xFCndeyken) \xB7 2 g\xF6lgeli"
  - key: lightsRecipe.K8A
    value: "\u2605ek: tavan ampul\xFC + masa lambas\u0131 + tezg\xE2h lambas\u0131
      (spot #FFD9A0, 34\xB0, g\xF6lgeli) \xB7 3 g\xF6lgeli; bu\u011Fu cam\u0131 ve
      vuru\u015F lambas\u0131 emission; k\xE2\u011F\u0131t albedosu 0,8"
  - key: lightsRecipe.K8G
    value: "\u2605ek: K8A ile ayn\u0131 \u0131\u015F\u0131klar; bu\u011Fu katman\u0131
      Transparent (fogFrost \u03B1 0,78)"
  - key: lightsRecipe.K8R
    value: "\u2605ek: K8A ile ayn\u0131; okuma pozunda tezg\xE2h lambas\u0131 k\xE2\u011F\u0131d\u0131
      ayd\u0131nlat\u0131r, g\xF6lge eli g\xF6stermez"
